  "description": "Seo Yeon-Woo is in love with his best friend, Cha Do-Jin, and he’s afraid of letting his feelings slip, knowing it could ruin their lifelong friendship forever. But when Yeon-Woo slowly distances himself from Do-Jin and makes friends with a new student named Baek Ha, Dojin starts developing feelings he’s never experienced before. Is it simple jealousy over losing his best friend? Or is it something more?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n *Note: Includes three side story chapters rated R19.*",
